          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Summary: Observation (naked eye and binoculars) of the silent SSO-NNE (south-south-east to north-north-east) movement of 7 to 9 dark objects with movements (rotational, distancing, approaching) as well as a separate identical object: observations of playful balloons.",
